# This repository contains only the Palm Secretary source projects.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!codex-secretary/
!codex-secretary/**
!palm-secretary-android/
!palm-secretary-android/**
!palm-secretary-harmony/
!palm-secretary-harmony/**

# Dependencies and generated output
**/node_modules/
**/oh_modules/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.hvigor/
**/.next/
**/.vinext/
**/.wrangler/
**/dist/
**/dist-server/
**/.openai/
**/.idea/
**/.test-tools/
**/.build-tools/
**/.browser-workspace/
**/.local-workspace/
**/.preview-workspace-*/
**/.protocol-schema-*/

# Secrets, signing material and local state
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/signing/
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.cer
**/*.crt
**/*.key
**/*.csr
**/*.pem
**/*.apk
**/*.hap
**/*.app
**/*.idsig
**/local.properties
**/*.log

